{"synopsis":"Seekor ular tua di desa secara tidak sengaja memakan pil manusia, membangkitkan kecerdasan spiritualnya. Sejak saat itu, ia memulai jalur kultivasi. Dalam rentang waktu satu dekade yang singkat, ular itu, yang tidak gentar oleh berlalunya waktu, memanfaatkan setiap momen. Ini adalah kisah tentang seekor ular tua yang menjadi abadi.","alternative_title":"Snake Immortal: The Tale of a Snake’s Cultivation to Immortality","author":"","artist":"","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"8cf8947f-9ac4-44e7-96ac-0cada159cd37","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-4397-9d43-c4f2f694a2c8/chapter_ch_98/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-4397-9d43-c4f2f694a2c8/chapter_ch_98/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-4397-9d43-c4f2f694a2c8/chapter_ch_98/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-4397-9d43-c4f2f694a2c8/chapter_ch_98/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-4397-9d43-c4f2f694a2c8/chapter_ch_98/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-4397-9d43-c4f2f694a2c8/chapter_ch_98/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-4397-9d43-c4f2f694a2c8/chapter_ch_98/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-4397-9d43-c4f2f694a2c8/chapter_ch_98/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-4397-9d43-c4f2f694a2c8/chapter_ch_98/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-4397-9d43-c4f2f694a2c8/chapter_ch_98/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"b7c3fc2a-f930-4dbe-9f2a-eb19d262c400","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-4397-9d43-c4f2f694a2c8/chapter_ch_97/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-4397-9d43-c4f2f694a2c8/chapter_ch_97/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1f242ae-1f7d-439